.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ot_O4spijfYQ7kNvwF8XHWu&_nc_oc=Adq7JAbBML3VJGnjUPDSM9E7fHyWV_Zam8uqJaVaYMcA_2TFPD7OasuHqNpztD1vX9M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9wHw76HGwDZ9aeyqc90jbLrnQbpa5E9gxA8f-Tx0DoA&oe=6AE9E079"}, {"file_name": "triforce-circle.png", "id": "917706974385601", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617762_917706977718934_2970232128500494362_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJ1zM0wx0_wQ7kNvwETzn_u&_nc_oc=AdqG4uXQt9ARcge64bmKNROiXiur9wOxyb9AN6hA1MnanK-DbslnlW5QebiXe4ZJddA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTu1KsKpYgKNkzsiaW0ZZrkeHuB9GnIIcTZ1AYSvyMBwg&oe=6AEA13B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zen Sand", "keywords": ["Meditation", "Mindfulness", "Relaxation", "Art", "Wellness"], "long_description": "# Zen Sand: AR Mandalas\nRelax and unwind as you create peaceful art to relax the heart, mind, and soul.\n\n## The Experience\nStep into a digital sanctuary where ancient tradition meets modern immersion. Inspired by the meticulous discipline of monks creating complex mandalas, this app transforms your environment into a canvas for mindfulness. \n\n* **Tactile Intuition**\nSimply close your hand into a fist to begin the flow of sand. Release to stop.\n\n* **Focus & Flow**\nEngage in the \"micro-moments\" of creation, focusing on the grain, the pattern, and the breath.\n\n* **Boundless Canvas**\nYou are only limited by your own creativity.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Fist-to-Flow:** Natural gesture control that mimics holding physical sand.\n- **AR Integration:** Layer your art over your real-world desk, floor, or garden.\n- **Zen Acoustics:** Procedural soundscapes that react to your movement and speed.\n- **Impermanence Mode:** Practice the art of letting go by clearing your canvas with a single gesture.\n\n---\n*Unwind. Create. Let go.*", "short_description": "Relax and unwind as you 